{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"event-bus","type":"text","text":"## EventBus\n\n**核心職責：**\n- 事件發布 (publish)\n- 事件分發 (dispatch)\n- 處理器註冊 (register)\n- 解耦發布者與訂閱者\n\n**技術實現：**\n- 使用反射掃描處理方法\n- 支持同步/異步執行\n- 基於類型匹配分發事件","x":-300,"y":-400,"width":400,"height":320,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"event-base","type":"text","text":"## Event (基類)\n\n**屬性：**\n- occurred_at: 事件發生時間\n\n**特性：**\n- 抽象基類\n- 不可變對象\n- 代表已發生的事實","x":400,"y":-400,"width":300,"height":240,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"order-placed-event","type":"text","text":"## OrderPlacedEvent\n訂單已下單事件\n\n**觸發時機：**\n客戶完成訂單創建\n\n**包含信息：**\n- order: Order 對象\n- 訂單ID、客戶、金額\n\n**業務含義：**\n客戶已確認購物車，\n等待付款","x":800,"y":-300,"width":280,"height":280,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"payment-completed-event","type":"text","text":"## PaymentCompletedEvent\n支付完成事件\n\n**觸發時機：**\n訂單支付成功\n\n**包含信息：**\n- order: Order 對象\n- 支付金額\n\n**業務含義：**\n客戶已完成支付，\n可以準備發貨","x":800,"y":20,"width":280,"height":260,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"order-shipped-event","type":"text","text":"## OrderShippedEvent\n訂單已發貨事件\n\n**觸發時機：**\n訂單從倉庫發出\n\n**包含信息：**\n- order: Order 對象\n- 客戶信息、地址\n\n**業務含義：**\n訂單已發出，\n正在配送途中","x":800,"y":320,"width":280,"height":260,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"order-cancelled-event","type":"text","text":"## OrderCancelledEvent\n訂單已取消事件\n\n**觸發時機：**\n訂單被取消\n\n**包含信息：**\n- order: Order 對象\n- previous_status: 取消前狀態\n\n**業務含義：**\n訂單已取消，\n需要回滾相關操作","x":800,"y":620,"width":280,"height":280,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"product-purchased-event","type":"text","text":"## ProductPurchasedEvent\n商品已購買事件\n\n**觸發時機：**\n訂單中的商品被購買\n\n**包含信息：**\n- product_id: 商品ID\n- product_name: 商品名稱\n- quantity: 購買數量\n- order_id: 訂單ID\n\n**業務含義：**\n用於統計分析、推薦系統","x":1150,"y":-300,"width":280,"height":320,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"inventory-reserved-event","type":"text","text":"## InventoryReservedEvent\n庫存已預留事件\n\n**觸發時機：**\n為訂單預留庫存\n\n**包含信息：**\n- product_id: 商品ID\n- quantity: 預留數量\n- order_id: 訂單ID\n\n**業務含義：**\n庫存已鎖定，\n等待訂單確認","x":1150,"y":80,"width":280,"height":300,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"low-stock-alert-event","type":"text","text":"## LowStockAlertEvent\n低庫存警告事件\n\n**觸發時機：**\n商品庫存低於閾值\n\n**包含信息：**\n- product: Product 對象\n- current_stock: 當前庫存\n- threshold: 警告閾值\n\n**業務含義：**\n庫存不足，\n需要補貨","x":1150,"y":420,"width":280,"height":300,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"order-event-handler","type":"text","text":"## OrderEventHandler\n訂單事件處理器\n\n**訂閱事件：**\n✓ OrderPlacedEvent\n✓ PaymentCompletedEvent\n✓ OrderShippedEvent\n✓ OrderCancelledEvent\n\n**處理邏輯：**\n- 發送確認郵件\n- 通知倉庫系統\n- 更新財務系統\n- 處理退款","x":-800,"y":-100,"width":350,"height":320,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"inventory-event-handler","type":"text","text":"## InventoryEventHandler\n庫存事件處理器\n\n**訂閱事件：**\n✓ InventoryReservedEvent\n✓ ProductPurchasedEvent\n✓ LowStockAlertEvent\n\n**處理邏輯：**\n- 檢查庫存水位\n- 發送低庫存警告\n- 統計銷售數據\n- 觸發補貨流程","x":-800,"y":280,"width":350,"height":320,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"analytics-handler","type":"text","text":"## AnalyticsHandler\n分析事件處理器\n\n**訂閱事件：**\n✓ 所有事件\n\n**處理邏輯：**\n- 記錄事件到分析系統\n- 統計業務指標\n- 生成報表數據\n- 監控系統健康度","x":-800,"y":660,"width":350,"height":280,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"notification-service","type":"text","text":"## NotificationService\n通知服務\n\n**訂閱事件：**\n✓ OrderPlacedEvent\n✓ PaymentCompletedEvent\n✓ OrderShippedEvent\n✓ OrderCancelledEvent\n✓ LowStockAlertEvent\n\n**處理邏輯：**\n- 發送郵件通知\n- 發送 SMS 通知\n- 推送 App 通知","x":-800,"y":1000,"width":350,"height":320,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"order-entity","type":"text","text":"## Order (訂單聚合)\n\n**發布的事件：**\n→ OrderPlacedEvent\n→ PaymentCompletedEvent\n→ OrderShippedEvent\n→ OrderCancelledEvent\n\n**業務方法：**\n- place(): 下單\n- pay(): 支付\n- ship(): 發貨\n- cancel(): 取消","x":400,"y":200,"width":300,"height":320,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"event-flow","type":"text","text":"## 典型事件流程\n\n**訂單處理流程：**\n\n1️⃣ 客戶下單\n   Order.place()\n   ↓\n   OrderPlacedEvent\n   ↓\n   • OrderEventHandler: 發送確認郵件\n   • InventoryEventHandler: 預留庫存\n   • NotificationService: 通知客戶\n   • AnalyticsHandler: 記錄數據\n\n2️⃣ 客戶付款\n   Order.pay()\n   ↓\n   PaymentCompletedEvent\n   ↓\n   • OrderEventHandler: 通知倉庫\n   • NotificationService: 付款成功通知\n   • AnalyticsHandler: 記錄付款\n\n3️⃣ 倉庫發貨\n   Order.ship()\n   ↓\n   OrderShippedEvent\n   ↓\n   • OrderEventHandler: 更新訂單狀態\n   • NotificationService: 發貨通知\n   • AnalyticsHandler: 記錄發貨","x":-300,"y":200,"width":500,"height":760,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"event-bus-pattern","type":"text","text":"## EventBus 設計模式\n\n**使用的模式：**\n\n1. **觀察者模式 (Observer)**\n   - 發布者不知道訂閱者\n   - 一對多的依賴關係\n\n2. **中介者模式 (Mediator)**\n   - EventBus 作為中介\n   - 減少對象間的直接依賴\n\n3. **單例模式 (Singleton)**\n   - 全局唯一的 EventBus\n   - 統一的事件管理\n\n**關鍵技術：**\n- 反射 (Reflection)\n- 類型註解 (Type Hints)\n- 約定優於配置 (Convention)\n- 異步執行 (Async Executor)","x":-800,"y":-600,"width":400,"height":460,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"product-entity","type":"text","text":"## Product (商品實體)\n\n**發布的事件：**\n→ ProductPurchasedEvent\n→ InventoryReservedEvent\n→ LowStockAlertEvent\n\n**業務方法：**\n- purchase(): 購買\n- reserve_stock(): 預留庫存\n- check_stock(): 檢查庫存","x":400,"y":720,"width":300,"height":300,"color":"2"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"edge-1","fromNode":"event-base","fromSide":"right","toNode":"order-placed-event","toSide":"left","color":"5","label":"繼承"},
